          "end_column": 16,
          "symbol": "ConditionalOperands.forward",
          "expression": "def forward(self, left, middle, right, choose):\n    a = torch.sin(left)\n    b = torch.tanh(torch.cos(middle))\n    if choose:\n        return torch.cat((a, b, torch.relu(right)), dim=-1)\n    return a"
        }
      ],
